@HostAddress = http://localhost:5104

### ==========================================
### 🏷️ KATEGORI (PARENT)
### ==========================================

### 1. GET List Kategori (Pagination)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Kategori?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 2. GET Single Kategori by ID
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Kategori/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. POST Tambah Kategori
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Kategori
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Nama": "Buku & Alat Tulis"
}

### 4. PATCH Ubah Kategori
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/Kategori/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Nama": "Elektronik & Gadget"
}

### 5. DELETE Kategori
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/Kategori/4
Accept: application/json


### ==========================================
### 📦 PRODUK (CHILD)
### ==========================================

### 6. GET List Produk (Pagination)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Produk?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 7. GET Single Produk by ID
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Produk/1
Accept: application/json

### 8. POST Tambah Produk
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Produk
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Nama": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "IdKategori": 1
}

### 9. PATCH Ubah Produk
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/Produk/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Nama": "Laptop Gaming ROG",
  "IdKategori": 1
}

### 10. DELETE Produk
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/Produk/8
Accept: application/json


### ==========================================
### ⚠️ ERROR CASES
### ==========================================

### Error 404: Kategori Tidak Ditemukan
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Kategori/999
Accept: application/json

### Error 400: Validasi Nama Kosong
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Produk
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Nama": "",
  "IdKategori": 1
}
